        "subject": "LU-19895 tests: probe sanity 243 hang in cl_inode_fini",
        "message": "LU-19895 tests: probe sanity 243 hang in cl_inode_fini\n\nProbe for the sanity test_243 hang on change 65094, where the last\nclose in group_lock_test test40 waits forever in cl_inode_fini()\nfor a reference nothing drops. Not for landing.\n\nTrack the cacheable cl_pages holding each object. When the last\nput has waited 30 seconds, print the object and every such page,\nand dump the debug log. Repeat test40 200 times in test_243 and\nfail it while the debug log still covers the hang.\n\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly testlist=sanity env=ONLY=243,ONLY_REPEAT=10\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanity env=ONLY=243,ONLY_REPEAT=10\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly clientdistro=el10.1 testlist=sanity env=ONLY=243,ONLY_REPEAT=10\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=sanity\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Icc7b5622c0f5b9c2b6553c5381f6cd94ef947807\n"
      },
